   "ImageDescription": {
    "value": "Relief at the Markt in Eindhoven, made by Jos Reniers in 1994. Remembering the liberation of Eindhoven during WWII.<br>\n<p><br>\nText on the left reads \"BEVRIJDING EINDHOVEN 1944-1994\" (<i>LIBERATION EINDHOVEN 1944-1994</i>).\n<br>\nText on the right:<br>\nUS 101ST AIRBORNE DIVISION<br>\nGENERAL MAXWELL D. TAYLOR<br>\nBRITISH 30TH CORPS<br>\nGENERAL BRIAN HORROCKS<br>\nWIE VRIJHEID VRAAGT<br>\nMOET DE ANDER VRIJHEID BIEDEN<br>\n<br>\n(<i>He who wants freedom</i>)<br>\n</p>\n(<i>must give it to others</i>)",
    "source": "commons-desc-page"
